    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "text": "Nightborn"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A couple’s dream of idyllic family life in the Finnish woods is shattered by the arrival of their nightmarish new baby, in Hanna Bergholm’s riotously gory folk horror."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Screening dates and booking"
